      "id": 492762,
      "username": "paulroberts",
      "name": "Paul",
      "created_at": "2026-01-28T18:48:15.562Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi, brand new user here, just signed up for the 14 day trial of ERPnext but can’t find the CRM module. If I search for it in the search I can access it, but it soon disappears from the left hand panel when you end up somewhere else. I just want to find a way to create leads, opportunities etc. but then use the selling module to build quotes, invoices etc. It’s a bit confusing to the new user.</p>\n<p>Now I read that the CRM module used to be separate but seems to be integrated now, but I can’t find it on the desktop - I need to make this easy to use for my team so is there a way to add a short cut?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/f/8fb5803f2a8ff180949f1daddf8fd774772c1a15.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/8fb5803f2a8ff180949f1daddf8fd774772c1a15\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/f/8fb5803f2a8ff180949f1daddf8fd774772c1a15_2_690x349.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"kvj8OZ4RTXoDXfXVnYfj6dDIF01\" width=\"690\" height=\"349\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/f/8fb5803f2a8ff180949f1daddf8fd774772c1a15_2_690x349.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/f/8fb5803f2a8ff180949f1daddf8fd774772c1a15_2_1035x523.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/f/8fb5803f2a8ff180949f1daddf8fd774772c1a15.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"ECF5FC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1114×565 27.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/d/dddf1f09c1d46dda73fc897ba311181925ff30d7.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/dddf1f09c1d46dda73fc897ba311181925ff30d7\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/d/dddf1f09c1d46dda73fc897ba311181925ff30d7_2_690x394.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"vELytmMoj7twRY8RZVnOEAur6tN\" width=\"690\" height=\"394\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/d/dddf1f09c1d46dda73fc897ba311181925ff30d7_2_690x394.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/d/dddf1f09c1d46dda73fc897ba311181925ff30d7_2_1035x591.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/d/dddf1f09c1d46dda73fc897ba311181925ff30d7.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"B8B8B8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1113×636 36 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/0/406d9b06ba81bbf09075807f4225720be89ed936.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/406d9b06ba81bbf09075807f4225720be89ed936\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/0/406d9b06ba81bbf09075807f4225720be89ed936_2_690x439.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"9bXnZtZIy2yJi8RWN8iP1XEBJfE\" width=\"690\" height=\"439\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/0/406d9b06ba81bbf09075807f4225720be89ed936_2_690x439.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/0/406d9b06ba81bbf09075807f4225720be89ed936_2_1035x658.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/0/406d9b06ba81bbf09075807f4225720be89ed936_2_