      "created_at": "2026-01-29T07:04:29.221Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think you are accessing the old (ERPNext) CRM module which has been discontinued.<br>\nIts now no longer part of ERPNext but has been spun off as a seperate app called Frappe CRM<br>\nOn the samescreen shot try the third option “Install (Frappe) CRM from Marketplace”<br>\nIf that does not work try this - <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/cloud/installing-an-app\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Installing an app</a></p>",
