      "id": 492834,
      "username": "paulroberts",
      "name": "Paul",
      "created_at": "2026-01-29T09:14:20.422Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ok this does look like the separate CRM product, yesterday when I was playing with the ERPnext CRM by searching for CRM and accessing the CRM Dashboard, I was able to create a lead, but that lead no longer shows in the Frappe CRM module I’ve just installed, I guess it’s a sepatae database…. (I had to pixelate the info as it’s a real customer)…</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/3/137df8285831ac9ccc960d91049b91412d13f0b7.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/137df8285831ac9ccc960d91049b91412d13f0b7\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/3/137df8285831ac9ccc960d91049b91412d13f0b7_2_690x344.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"2MqXwt5MkccHVnGe5ZGBTkKD0SX\" width=\"690\" height=\"344\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/3/137df8285831ac9ccc960d91049b91412d13f0b7_2_690x344.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/3/137df8285831ac9ccc960d91049b91412d13f0b7_2_1035x516.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/3/137df8285831ac9ccc960d91049b91412d13f0b7.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF6F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1269×634 63.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
