      "created_at": "2026-01-29T09:14:58.567Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/0/40f4695e3cd1fcbce9e88e91059e8fc018c58b96.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/40f4695e3cd1fcbce9e88e91059e8fc018c58b96\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/0/40f4695e3cd1fcbce9e88e91059e8fc018c58b96_2_690x412.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"9gCcRLe6ZBnq1bwV1Mcsctz3T5c\" width=\"690\" height=\"412\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/0/40f4695e3cd1fcbce9e88e91059e8fc018c58b96_2_690x412.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/0/40f4695e3cd1fcbce9e88e91059e8fc018c58b96.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/0/40f4695e3cd1fcbce9e88e91059e8fc018c58b96.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBF5F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">869×520 62.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I would prefer to use the CRM that comes with ERPnext rather than having a separate product/database, but it needs to be easily accessible, so until I have figured that out I can’t really recommend this to my team. I’m sure it’s something dead simple to set up.</p>",
