    {
      "id": 492879,
      "username": "brian_pond",
      "name": "Brian Pond",
      "created_at": "2026-01-29T18:14:01.375Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/paulroberts\">@paulroberts</a></p>\n<p>Last I knew, there were still 2 separate CRMs:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The original one native to ERPNext.</li>\n<li>The new “Frappe CRM”, a separate and standalone application.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>They’ve never shared data or integrated.</p>\n<p>I have a Version 16 self-hosted, and I only see the original CRM.  Not the new “Frappe CRM\".  I suspect you’re getting a different user experience because you’re testing the official cloud.</p>\n<p>I agree it’s very confusing.  With luck, perhaps one of the official maintainers will chime in, and offer some clarity.</p>",
